== Trivia ==

* Although she only appears twice during [[Winds of Change]], she is frequently mentioned during various quests and [[Winds of Change encounters|encounters]].
* During [[The Final Confrontation]], she makes use of skills similar to those available to [[GW2:Mesmer|mesmers]] in [[Guild Wars 2]].
* There is a [[miniature]] [[Miniature Minister Reiko|version]] of this NPC.
* She uses [[Dervish]] emotes.
* According to [[John Stumme]], "Reiko" was chosen as a name without regard to any possible meaning in Japanese.

